# Derivatives desk
#
# Shows:   `on order where` narrowing by the instrument's columns; options and
#          futures accepted and filled, uncovered puts rejected
# Needs:   Arm it on LOOP-MKT. Send options or futures from Sent Orders (the New
#          dialog's Instrument section) or run futures-roll on LOOP-CLI
# Watch:   Received Orders' Instrument column; the Macro Runs log
# Outcome: each option or future is filled at its limit price after a moment;
#          an uncovered put is rejected; stocks are left to other macros

on order where security_type in ['OPT', 'OOF', 'FUT']
    if order.put_or_call == 'Put' and order.covered_uncovered == 'Uncovered'
        reject text: 'this desk writes no uncovered puts'
        pass 'rejected ${order.instrument}: uncovered put'
    accept
    after 200ms
    fill qty: order.order_qty, price: order.price
    pass 'filled ${order.cum_qty} ${order.instrument}'
